# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
# |<----------- max 72 characters ----------->|

# Body (optional): explain WHAT changed and WHY, not how. Wrap at 72.

# Footer (optional): "BREAKING CHANGE: ...", "Closes #123", ...

# ── Conventional Commits ────────────────────────────────────────────
# type:  feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | perf | test | build |
#        ci | chore | revert
# scope: stack | provider | config | app | axum | tracing | docs | ci
#        (optional, lowercase)
# breaking change: append ! after type/scope, e.g. feat(stack)!: ...
#
# Examples:
#   feat(axum): deliver router via add_routes
#   fix(stack): abort timed-out shutdown hooks
#   docs: explain the strict provider order
